t pending application/pre-application dates (09/18/2024, 02/06/2025, Northline inquiry 07/02/2025), 3 MW-AC requested = 100% of 3.0 MW published headroom, and heavier weighting for export-only pure generation. Reconcile queue and existing DER, re-run thermal, voltage and protection screens with current peak/minimum load, supersede the stale 1.8 MW interim memo, and incorporate validated result in next quarterly republication; do not overwrite 3.0 MW in historical HCM-2024-Q2. 08/14 is a status and re-study scheduling checkpoint before the League response, not a promise of completed study or republication. Keep action open until the validated result is reflected in a controlled refresh; flag delays to Regulatory Affairs.","status":"New","type":"Task","priority":"High","assignee":"June Halloway","author":"OpenProject Admin","project_id":3,"done_ratio":0,"start_date":"","due_date":"2025-08-14","ignore_non_working_days":false,"created_at":"2026-11-18T19:20:00.909Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T19:20:00.909Z"},"error":"","warning":""},"isError":false}}

